<title>USA: Florence Cty sale stopped, resheduled for July 22.</title>
<headline>Florence Cty sale stopped, resheduled for July 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Florence County School District No.1, S.C., $5.30 million general obligation bond issue was cancelled after the auction due to technical problems.</p>
<p>The sale has been resheduled for July 22 at 1200 EDT. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
